{
  "soleID": "YzmLuck",
  "createTicks": 638707392150156880,
  "name": "【月之门】<size=26><color=#990000>天命气运多选 (Select Multiple Destiny)</color></size>",
  "author": "月之门_LIJL",
  "desc": "\r\n1、气运多选多锁：\r\n开局气运可选择3个或以上，可锁定多个气运；\r\n<color=#990000>阴阳眼、噬魂剑、莲花剑意三个天命气运可同时选择</color>；\r\n可选择多个游戏通关的奖励气运；\r\n并且对玩家信息界面的先天气运UI进行了优化，选择多个气运时，不会再挡住下面的资质属性面板。\r\n\r\n2、筛选开局气运品质：\r\n开局随机出的气运品质可<color=#990000>自定义</color>，可以<color=#990000>全红</color>、全橙、或任意搭配；\r\n\n3、一步到位选择你需要的气运：\n点击此模组气运筛选面板的“书本”按钮，可以直接打开气运列表查看<color=#990000>所有可选的气运</color>，并选择你需要的气运。\n\r\n4、随时更换逆天改命：\n在境界突破界面，<color=#990000>点击</color>自己已经拥有的<color=#990000>逆天改命</color>，就会弹出更换界面。\n\n5、玩家角色界面特效开关：\r\n如果你<color=#990000>同时拥有阴阳眼、噬魂剑、莲花剑意，那你的角色界面中这三个特效会叠加在一起，看起来很混乱</color>，此功能允许你随时<color=#990000>关闭或显示</color>任一特效。\r\n打开玩家信息界面，点击<color=#990000>角色立绘左上角的“放大镜”</color>，就会显示开关面板。\r\n\r\n\r\n使用注意事项：\r\n1、在开局创建角色时，点击气运面板的“锁”图标打开气运配置界面，注意在选择完气运开始游戏时，不要关闭这个面板，直接点开始游戏就行，否则选项会不生效。\r\n（同理如果你不想用这个气运筛选功能，把面板关闭即可，气运刷新方式会恢复为原版游戏的样子）\r\n\r\n2、关于游戏通关奖励气运，在开启面板时不会在气运池里显示，如果你勾选了指定通关气运，开始游戏后，会在首次进入大地图时给你添加到先天气运中。\r\n\r\n3、其它待补充，有BUG请反馈；\r\n* 此模组可随时卸载；\r\n* 喜欢的话请给模组<color=#990000>点个赞</color>；\r\n* 模组交流与BUG反馈群：695737854\r\n\r\n===================Machine Translation=======================\n1、Born Fate Multi-selection, Multi-locking:\r\nYou can select more than 3 born fates and lock multiple fates.\r\n<color=#990000>The three major Fates can be selected together: Spirit Sight、Soul Reaver、Lotus Sword's Will</color>；\r\nYou can select multiple fates from the game completion rewards.\r\nAdditionally, the UI for innate fates on the player information screen has been optimized. When selecting multiple fates, it will no longer block the qualification attributes panel below.\r\n\r\n2、Filter Born Fate Quality:\r\nThe quality of the randomly generated starting fates can be <color=#990000>customized</color>, with options for <color=#990000>all red</color>, all orange, or any combination.\r\n\n3、Select the fates you need in one step:\nClick the \"Book\" button on the fate filter panel to directly open the fate list, where you can view <color=#990000>all available fates</color> and select the ones you need.\r\n\n4、Change Rewrite Destiny\r：\nAt any time. In the realm breakthrough interface, <color=#990000>click on the Rewrite Destiny</color> you already possess, and a replacement interface will pop up.\n\n5、Player Character Interface Special Effect Switch:\r\nIf you <color=#990000>simultaneously have the Spirit Sight、Soul Reaver and Lotus Sword's Will</color>, the three special effects will stack on your character interface, making it appear very cluttered. This feature allows you to <color=#990000>turn off or display</color> any effect at any time.\r\nOpen the player information interface and click the <color=#990000>magnifying glass</color> at the top left corner of the character illustration to display the toggle panel.",
